[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1430","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1430/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1430/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1430/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/1430","id":2342063723,"node_id":"PR_kwDOBssQHM5x4YrL","number":1430,"title":"pyrogram: update MIN_CHANNEL_ID and MIN_CHAT_ID","user":{"login":"rebeeh","id":135997849,"node_id":"U_kgDOCBspmQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135997849?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rebeeh","html_url":"https://github.com/rebeeh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rebeeh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rebeeh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rebeeh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rebeeh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rebeeh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rebeeh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rebeeh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rebeeh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rebeeh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2024-06-09T07:06:39Z","updated_at":"2024-11-10T10:30:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/pulls/1430","html_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/1430","diff_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/1430.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/1430.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"# Contribution Request: Update MIN_CHANNEL_ID and MIN_CHAT_ID in Pyrogram\r\n\r\n### Title: Update MIN_CHANNEL_ID and MIN_CHAT_ID to Fix \"Peer id invalid\" Error\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nThis contribution request proposes an update to the `MIN_CHANNEL_ID` and `MIN_CHAT_ID` values in Pyrogram. The current values are causing a \"Peer id invalid\" error in some scenarios. This update changes the `MIN_CHANNEL_ID` to `-1007852516352` and the `MIN_CHAT_ID` to `-999999999999` to address this issue.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n\r\n- **Old Value**: `MIN_CHANNEL_ID = -1002147483647`\r\n- **New Value**: `MIN_CHANNEL_ID = -1007852516352`\r\n- **Old Value**: `MIN_CHAT_ID = -2147483647`\r\n- **New Value**: `MIN_CHAT_ID = -999999999999`\r\n\r\n### Reason for Change\r\n\r\nThe existing `MIN_CHANNEL_ID` and `MIN_CHAT_ID` values are no longer valid in certain cases, leading to the \"Peer id invalid\" error. By updating the values, we aim to resolve this error and ensure that Pyrogram can handle channel and chat IDs correctly.\r\n\r\n### Code Update\r\n\r\nThe change will be made in the relevant Pyrogram file where `MIN_CHANNEL_ID` and `MIN_CHAT_ID` are defined.\r\n\r\n```python\r\n# Current values\r\nMIN_CHANNEL_ID = -1002147483647\r\nMIN_CHAT_ID = -2147483647\r\n\r\n# Updated values\r\nMIN_CHANNEL_ID = -1007852516352\r\nMIN_CHAT_ID = -999999999999\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n\r\nTo verify this change, tests will be conducted to ensure that channel and chat IDs are processed correctly without causing the \"Peer id invalid\" error. Specific test cases will include:\r\n\r\n- Creating a channel with an ID greater than `-1007852516352` and verifying successful handling.\r\n- Creating a chat with an ID greater than `-999999999999` and verifying successful handling.\r\n- Handling channel and chat IDs close to the boundary values to ensure no off-by-one errors or similar issues.\r\n- General regression testing to ensure no other functionality is impacted.\r\n\r\n### Impact\r\n\r\nThis update is expected to fix the \"Peer id invalid\" error without introducing any breaking changes. All existing functionalities should remain intact, with improved reliability in handling channel and chat IDs.\r\n\r\n### Acknowledgements\r\n\r\nSpecial thanks to the users and developers who identified and reported the \"Peer id invalid\" error and contributed to the discussion around the solution.\r\n\r\n### Additional Notes\r\n\r\nPlease review and merge this contribution to improve the robustness of Pyrogram in handling Telegram channel and chat IDs. If there are any questions or further suggestions, I am available to discuss them.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\n**Submitted by**: [ebiza](telegram.me/ebiza)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1430/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1430/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/788","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/788/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/788/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/788/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/788","id":1063192000,"node_id":"PR_kwDOBssQHM4vAAc_","number":788,"title":"feat: add attribute \"correct\" for PollOption","user":{"login":"dashezup","id":67376103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mzc2MTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67376103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dashezup","html_url":"https://github.com/dashezup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dashezup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dashezup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dashezup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dashezup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dashezup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dashezup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dashezup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dashezup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dashezup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2021-11-25T06:07:14Z","updated_at":"2022-10-15T13:51:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/pulls/788","html_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/788","diff_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/788.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/788.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"I found that I can't find which answer is correct in a quiz poll. so I created this PR to add the \"correct\" option for PollOption. This is an essential feature that I need for one of my project.\r\n\r\nI've made the \"correct\" option optional.\r\n\r\nExample result of result of PollOption of a quiz poll\r\n\r\n```\r\n{                                                                                                                                                                                     \"_\": \"types.PollAnswerVoters\",\r\n    \"option\": \"b'2'\",             \r\n    \"voters\": 2,              \r\n    \"chosen\": false,          \r\n    \"correct\": false                                                                 \r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI've tested it locally by install it from git repo. seems to work fine (when I print the message/poll, it shows \"correct\" in poll option when it's a quiz poll, or no \"correct\" attribute when the poll type is not quiz)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/788/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/788/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/681","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/681/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/681/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/681/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/681","id":891382343,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NjQ0MjU5OTAy","number":681,"title":"Add method to set the History TTL","user":{"login":"ColinShark","id":33236409,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMjM2NDA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33236409?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinShark","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinShark","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinShark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinShark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinShark/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinShark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinShark/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinShark/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinShark/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinShark/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinShark/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2021-05-13T21:14:03Z","updated_at":"2022-10-15T13:51:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/pulls/681","html_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/681","diff_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/681.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/681.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"`app.set_history_ttl(chat_id, period)` to automatically delete messages after either a day (`86400`) or a week (`604800`). `0` to disable.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/681/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/681/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1157","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1157/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1157/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1157/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/1157","id":1486727858,"node_id":"PR_kwDOBssQHM5E54pB","number":1157,"title":"Add support for Forum Topic and update to layer 160","user":{"login":"wulan17","id":18455603,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDU1NjAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18455603?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wulan17","html_url":"https://github.com/wulan17","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wulan17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wulan17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wulan17/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wulan17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wulan17/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wulan17/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wulan17/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wulan17/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wulan17/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2022-12-09T13:04:49Z","updated_at":"2024-08-31T09:14:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/pulls/1157","html_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/1157","diff_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/1157.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/1157.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Changes:\r\n\r\n- Add message_thread_id and is_topic_message field to Message\r\n- Add topics field to Message ~~(only returned using get_messages())~~\r\n- Add is_forum field to Chat\r\n- Add can_manage_topics field to ChatPrivileges and ChatPermissions\r\n- Add message_thread_id parameter to send_animation, send_audio, send_cached_media, send_chat_action, send_contact, send_dice, send_document, send_game, send_location, send_media_group, send_message, send_photo, send_poll, send_sticker, send_venue, send_video, send_video_note, and send_voice methods\r\n- Add message_thread_id parameter to forward_message(), and copy_message() methods\r\n- Add message_thread_id parameter to forward(), and copy() bound methods\r\n- Add ForumTopic, ForumTopicCreated, ForumTopicEdited, ForumTopicClosed, ForumTopicReopened, GeneralTopicHidden, GeneralTopicUnhidden Class\r\n- Add PeerChannel and PeerUser Class\r\n- Add CREATED_FORUM_TOPIC,EDITED_FORUM_TOPIC,DELETED_FORUM_TOPIC ChatEventType\r\n- Add create_forum_topic, edit_forum_topic, close_forum_topic, and reopen_forum_topic methods\r\n- Add close_general_topic, edit_general_topic, reopen_general_topic, hide_general_topic, unhide_general_topic methods\r\n- Update API SCHEMA to layer 160\r\n- Add TOPIC_CLOSED and TOPIC_DELETED to known errors\r\n- Update some methods to support layer 160\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n## Topic Management\r\n```python\r\nwith Client(app_id,app_hash) as app:\r\n    app.create_forum_topic(\"Topic Title\")\r\n    app.edit_forum_topic(chat_id,topic_id,\"New Topic Title\")\r\n    app.close_forum_topic(chat_id,topic_id)\r\n    app.reopen_forum_topic(chat_id,topic_id)\r\n    app.delete_forum_topic(chat_id,topic_id)\r\n    app.edit_general_topic(chat_id, \"New General Topic Name\")\r\n    app.close_general_topic(chat_id)\r\n    app.reopen_general_topic(chat_id)\r\n    app.hide_general_topic(chat_id)\r\n    app.unhide_general_topic(chat_id)\r\n```\r\n## Send message to spesific topic\r\n```python\r\n@app.on_message()\r\nasync def func(client,message):\r\n    chat_id = message.chat.id\r\n    message_thread_id = message.message_thread_id\r\n    app.send_message(chat_id=chat_id, text=\"text\", message_thread_id=message_thread_id)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Check if chat is forum\r\n```python\r\n@app.on_message()\r\nasync def check_forum(client, message):\r\n    if message.chat.is_forum:\r\n        ...\r\n```\r\nOr\r\n```python\r\n@app.on_message()\r\nasync def check_forum(client, message):\r\n    if message.is_topic_message: (not work for message from general topic)\r\n        ...\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1157/reactions","total_count":15,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":12,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1157/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/720","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/720/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/720/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/720/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/720","id":941705280,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0Njg3NTM5NTQz","number":720,"title":"Add conversation support","user":{"login":"Mahesh0253","id":44301650,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxNjUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301650?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mahesh0253","html_url":"https://github.com/Mahesh0253","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mahesh0253/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mahesh0253/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mahesh0253/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mahesh0253/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mahesh0253/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mahesh0253/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mahesh0253/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mahesh0253/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mahesh0253/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2021-07-12T06:08:09Z","updated_at":"2023-06-17T19:51:36Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/pulls/720","html_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/720","diff_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/720.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pyrogram/pyrogram/pull/720.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Many developers looking for conversation support in Pyrogram. For that these 3 methods are implemented. (Credit: [pyromod](https://github.com/usernein/pyromod))\r\n\r\n- wait_for_message\r\n- wait_for_callback_query\r\n- ask - Bound method for Message\r\n\r\n```python\r\n#  Example of wait_for_message\r\n\r\nclient.send_message(chat_id, \"What is your name?\")\r\nreply = client.wait_for_message(chat_id)\r\nclient.send_message(chat_id, f\"Hello {reply.text}\")\r\n\r\n# Bound method\r\n\r\nreply = message.ask(\"What is your name?\")\r\nclient.send_message(chat_id, f\"Hello {reply.text}\")\r\n\r\n# Example of wait_for_callback\r\n\r\nclient.send_message(chat_id, \"Choose any one button\", reply_markup=reply_markup)\r\ncallback_query = client.wait_for_callback_query(chat_id)\r\nprint(\"Callback data:\", callback_query.data)\r\n```\r\n\r\n**If this pull request need some improvements, let me know I will improve it or you can make pull request for same.**","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/720/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":9,"-1":2,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/720/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1402","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1402/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1402/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyrogram/pyrogram/issues/1402/events","html_url":